# SmartRetailX no longer compiles environment-specific VITE_* values into the
# JavaScript bundle. Runtime configuration is loaded from /config.json before
# React starts, allowing the same immutable SPA artifact to move through
# development, test, staging and production.
#
# For local development, copy and edit public/config.json if the checked-in
# safe placeholder values do not match the environment you are using.
# Never put a client secret, password, token or AWS credential in config.json;
# every value in that file is public browser configuration.
